<title>USA: Country Maid Foods completes purchase.</title>
<headline>Country Maid Foods completes purchase.</headline>
<dateline>AURORA, Mo. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Country Maid Foods Inc said on Tuesday that it completed the acquisition of 100 percent of the outstanding shares of Harrington-Chase PLC of London for an undisclosed amount of cash and stock.</p>
<p>Harrington-Chase is primarily engaged in the import and export of agriculture related products, which, Country Maid said, will give it a strong presence in the European Union.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
